              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Statutory EBITDA is the reported result before interest, tax, depreciation and amortisation. Management Adjusted EBITDA adds back the approved categories under ADR-0013. Covenant EBITDA follows the credit agreement (CA-021 to CA-030) on a rolling twelve months, with the sponsor fee capped. Over the same twelve months Adjusted and Covenant EBITDA coincide in this baseline, because the cap does not bite and the covenant FX add-back has no population — an outcome, not a definition.",
